lass="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/adana"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/adana.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Adana</span><span class="enc-type">Place</span><span class="enc-snip">Adana is a city of southern Turkey on the Seyhan river in the Cilician plain, one of the largest cities in the country.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/adandozan"><span class="enc-name">Adandozan</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">Adandozan was king of Dahomey from 1797 to 1818.</span></a></li></ul>
